<title>UK: KfW sets 500 million mark step-up callable bond.</title>
<headline>KfW sets 500 million mark step-up callable bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager D G Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KREDITANSTALT FUER WIEDERAUFBAU</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.125    MATURITY   *05.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  102.05    PAY DATE    05.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.25	LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO DECEMBER 1997, THEN STEPS UP TO 5.40 PCT IF NOT</p>
<p>		 CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC   1.50</p>
<p> NOTES	INHABERSCHULTSCHREIBUNG</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
